> > Ack. Let's use this opportunity to make the error propagation more precise and consistent with Create|Kill-container/Create|Kill-podsandbox. Please add [two SyncActions](https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/blob/9d967ff97332a024b8ae5ba89c83c239474f42fd/pkg/kubelet/container/sync_result.go#L54-L71) for UpdateContainer & UpdatePodSandbox, define [two new errors](https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/blob/9d967ff97332a024b8ae5ba89c83c239474f42fd/pkg/kubelet/container/sync_result.go#L37-L48) associated with them, and follow the [killPodwithSyncResult](https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/blob/9d967ff97332a024b8ae5ba89c83c239474f42fd/pkg/kubelet/kuberuntime/kuberuntime_manager.go#L1467-L1485) pattern for doPodResizeAction. Thanks.
